[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13620.309, "timestamp": "03:47:00", "text": "正确的？训练中是训练中是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13622.79, "timestamp": "03:47:02", "text": "地狱。比如，如果你在学习，你就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13625.349, "timestamp": "03:47:05", "text": "简直是地狱般的体验，而你就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13627.189, "timestamp": "03:47:07", "text": "训练简直是地狱。然后你就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13630.229, "timestamp": "03:47:10", "text": "出去之后，简直就像身处地狱。这里依然是地狱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13632.71, "timestamp": "03:47:12", "text": "但呃，这是另一种地狱。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13636.389, "timestamp": "03:47:16", "text": "美好的。我想，这大概是一种更美好的地狱吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13638.63, "timestamp": "03:47:18", "text": "我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13641.51, "timestamp": "03:47:21", "text": "等等，这个培训什么时候开始？呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13645.189, "timestamp": "03:47:25", "text": "状态呃阶段呃结束？多少年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13648.389, "timestamp": "03:47:28", "text": "它？数月。仅仅一年。一年，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13651.429, "timestamp": "03:47:31", "text": "一年的培训。但研究你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13653.75, "timestamp": "03:47:33", "text": "需要四年的学习和一年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13655.59, "timestamp": "03:47:35", "text": "训练。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13659.11, "timestamp": "03:47:39", "text": "哦，大概是四年零一年吧。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13661.03, "timestamp": "03:47:41", "text": "比如五年。你必须学习"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13668.15, "timestamp": "03:47:48", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13672.63, "timestamp": "03:47:52", "text": "这其中涉及很多方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13677.03, "timestamp": "03:47:57", "text": "很多。就像你一样，我感觉自己好老。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13679.51, "timestamp": "03:47:59", "text": "对不起。但是，你见过这样的吗？"}]